fense:</strong> Work together to guard the shack or venture into the woods as a team to locate and clear the portals.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE FINAL BLOOM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purify every Nest to find the fabled <strong>Golden Seed</strong>. Plant it in the center of your clearing and protect its light to break the hold over the woods once and for all. Choose to leave the forest behind as a survivor or stay to tend your farm in a land that is finally quiet.</p>","developers":["Green Vector Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636520/b8a7e83a4a76b0047c23ad278346090ac810036f/header.jpg?t=1773055012","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Green Vector Games. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3636520/1072526006/4550955a922a705fb28673543ccd900d3a2877a4/1772935765/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772979853","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3636520/1072526006/4550955a922a705fb28673543ccd900d3a2877a4/1772935765/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772979853","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3636520/1072526006/4550955a922a705fb28673543ccd900d3a2877a4/1772935765/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1772979853","id":257188151,"name":"Harvest Scream - Demo Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257188151/1e92e17d3692e18902d48e8003a9add41a9f5e3d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1772979853"}],"name":